TEED family notice
==================

Code provenance
---------------
The neural-network architecture in ``nn.py`` is ported from:

    https://github.com/xavysp/TEED
    commit 40fa4b1391dc6424f88989d0ca75d5b592c8681d
    License: MIT
    Copyright (c) 2022 Xavier Soria Poma

Only the TEED runtime architecture and its Smish activation are ported. The
LibreYOLO task wrapper, preprocessing graph, result contract, dataset loader,
validator, metrics, and export integration are original LibreYOLO code under
the repository MIT license.

Weights and data
----------------
No TEED checkpoint is bundled or mirrored. The upstream released checkpoint
was trained on BIPED, whose published terms restrict the dataset to
non-commercial use. ``weights/convert_teed_weights.py`` operates only on a
local checkpoint supplied by the user and does not alter its applicable
terms.

